From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 17:57:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: AI Coach sees the profile, nightly sleep times and
 vitals, and blood pressure

The coach context gains three fork-only lines under the existing data consent:
- PROFILE: age, sex, height, weight and max HR (manual override or Tanaka).
- NIGHTS: last 14 days, bed/wake times plus SpO2, respiration and skin
  temperature per night (deviation first, absolute wrist C as fallback).
- BLOOD PRESSURE: Lab Book readings of the last 30 days with the average,
  no longer behind the second "signals" switch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
